---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Sale - Rewild" description="Terms of sale for bookings made with Rewild.">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <Nav />

  <!-- Terms of sale -->
  <section class="bg-cream min-h-screen pt-32 pb-40 md:pt-44 md:pb-56">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-4xl md:text-5xl text-forest mb-14 leading-tight">Terms of sale</h1>

        <div class="space-y-12 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl text-forest mb-6 leading-tight">About Rewild</h2>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              {[
                'Rewild is operated by Rewild Stewart-Simonsen, a sole proprietorship (enkeltpersonforetak) registered in Norway, organisation number 938 483 833.',
                'Registered address: Bjørkedalvegen 694, 3948 Porsgrunn, Norway.',
                'Contact: ewa@re-wild.no',
              ].map(item => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sage-light flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span class="text-[1.08rem] text-forest font-light leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl text-forest mb-6 leading-tight">Payment</h2>
            <p>
              All prices are listed in Norwegian kroner (NOK) and are shown on each event's page. Payment is made in full via Vipps at the time of booking, unless otherwise agreed. Your booking is confirmed once payment has been received.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl text-forest mb-6 leading-tight">Right of withdrawal</h2>
            <p>
              Under the Norwegian Right of Cancellation Act (angrerettloven) §22 letter n, the standard 14-day right of withdrawal does not apply to bookings for leisure activities that are to take place on a specific date or within a specific period, such as Rewild's hikes and sessions. Cancellations are instead handled under the policy below.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl text-forest mb-6 leading-tight">Cancellations</h2>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              {[
                'If Rewild cancels a session due to hazardous weather or other conditions outside our control, you will be offered a full refund or a free rebooking.',
                'If you need to cancel your own booking, please contact us as early as possible at ewa@re-wild.no so we can let you know your options.',
              ].map(item => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sage-light flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span class="text-[1.08rem] text-forest font-light leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl text-forest mb-6 leading-tight">Complaints</h2>
            <p>
              If you have a complaint about a booking or session, please contact us at ewa@re-wild.no and we will do our best to resolve it directly. If we're unable to reach an agreement, you may bring the matter to the Norwegian Consumer Council (Forbrukerrådet) or the Consumer Authority (Forbrukertilsynet).
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <Footer />

</Layout>
